<section class="page-intro section-shell"><span class="eyebrow">The small print / A clear point of view</span><h1>YOUR <span class="serif-word">privacy.</span></h1></section><article class="legal-copy section-shell"><h2>About this concept website</h2><p>This is a proposed website for Stolen Tribe LLC. This page describes the behavior of this static concept. The studio should review and approve its final privacy policy before public launch.</p><h2>Contacting the studio</h2><p>The contact form prepares a draft in your email application. It does not send a message, upload your information to a server or store your draft. You choose whether to send the email. Emails you send directly are received by the studio through its email provider.</p><h2>Embedded films</h2><p>No video player is loaded until you choose to watch a film. Clicking a play button connects to Vimeo or YouTube. Those providers may process your IP address and browser information and use cookies according to their own policies. YouTube films use its privacy-enhanced embed domain.</p><p>Read the <a href="https://vimeo.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vimeo privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This concept does not set its own cookies, run advertising scripts or use analytics. Fonts and images are served with the site. Its hosting provider may process technical request information when delivering pages.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p></article>
